          SIZE 73.8 BY 1 AT ROW 6.95 COL 82.2
          BGCOLOR 5 FGCOLOR 15 FONT 6
     RECT-1 AT ROW 8.05 COL 6
     RECT-2 AT ROW 8.05 COL 82.2
     RECT-3 AT ROW 4.91 COL 6
     RECT-4 AT ROW 3 COL 6
     RECT-5 AT ROW 3 COL 57.4
     RECT-6 AT ROW 2.91 COL 108
